            <p>This miniature codex consists of three boards (I-III). I.a is uninscribed; I.b, II.a and II.b have fractions.III.a. and III.b are uninscribed, and the latter seems to have been the outer side of the codex. Sides I.b and II.a have two columns of writing, II.b has one. The dimensions provided may vary by 1mm depending on the board.</p>
